\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iS4RIwA38L2jVdNnbs6TUwyKn76.jpg\"},{\"id\":1988419,\"name\":\"Bahattin Doğan\",\"character\":\"Babaruhi\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1001787,\"name\":\"Ufuk Karali\",\"character\":\"Dursun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/imr6CHiagRbk3cIz65zagV6EiLk.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1288069,\"title\":\"Tenzing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eI0QW02PYqhnmIvLRdn9vrfVVP7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tKvVgMfM6GS4AGZn2KhP8bX1mJm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A determined man embarks on a high-stakes quest—and defies seemingly impossible odds—to fulfill his dream of being the first to reach the summit of Mount Everest.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1495,\"title\":\"Kingdom of Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79,\"title\":\"Hero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During China's Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king's life three years ago.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":796185,\"title\":\"The Three Musketeers: D'Artagnan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hfExJPcbBtDeFDEb7I1By72Drlr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lx89oBeJIastndjbQxznnfSYpmR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"D'Artagnan, a spirited young Gascon, is left for dead after trying to save a noblewoman from being kidnapped. Once in Paris, he tries by all means to find his attackers, unaware that his quest will lead him to the very heart of a war where the future of France is at stake. Aided by King's Musketeers Athos, Porthos and Aramis, he faces the machinations of villainous Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter, while falling in love with Constance, the Queen's confidante.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11362,\"title\":\"The Count of Monte Cristo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Htj4cXnhQNshE8Ce8sA6QVV3vf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1167307,\"title\":\"David\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7lFG1WrCwAxBfyGK8ahlBVzXno7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZ6J2g6HCV2gj3iuCdSxcyBXq9c.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the songs of his mother’s heart to the whispers of a faithful God, David’s story begins in quiet devotion. When the giant Goliath rises to terrorize a nation, a young shepherd armed with only a sling, a few stones, and unshakable faith steps forward. Pursued by power and driven by purpose, his journey tests the limits of loyalty, love, and courage—culminating in a battle not just for a crown, but for the soul of a kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":975511,\"title\":\"The Return\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xSj6EbdwHs3MFT2tRj9L3I7TE5j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vgT0kAaWU88do5RrCfHhXRVPnXM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After twenty years away, Odysseus washes up on the shores of Ithaca, haggard and unrecognizable. The king has finally returned home, but much has changed in his kingdom since he left to fight in the Trojan war.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9477,\"title\":\"King Arthur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKLZEAnjzr51Ij7TJtNejc5CN3i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzxTnjc3IyVEjISyu3WyyHM0QI6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the 'Sarmatian hypothesis' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":606856,\"title\":\"Togo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/921q4gPNN4J6UxvKaw6SCNBe3F8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Jr2OBzoLLOYqQWnyN4eicZv0sL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The untold true story set in the winter of 1925 that takes you across the treacherous terrain of the Alaskan tundra for an exhilarating and uplifting adventure that will test the strength, courage and determination of one man, Leonhard Seppala, and his lead sled dog, Togo.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":205775,\"title\":\"In the Heart of the Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/weVvNPfk6FM9vBg3BXtRtNAmiYM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4LRLz2V63TSwuQhBVNXsbnHxgoY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the winter of 1820, the New England whaling ship Essex is assaulted by something no one could believe—a whale of mammoth size and will, and an almost human sense of vengeance.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":314095,\"title\":\"The Lost City of Z\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8SxHVNk6tqXYwygmDzz1YuJEm2J.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/upatBMqiS0gSiNy52cwxKKcNne2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A true-life drama in the 1920s, centering on British explorer Col. Percy Fawcett, who discovered evidence of a previously unknown, advanced civilization in the Amazon and disappeared whilst searching for it.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":253412,\"title\":\"Everest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2jKOu2bjpLP6NXJcm7Ep14bDGtA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/P7d3lyBaYbAXVor6iB2avLvc4K.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Inspired by the incredible events surrounding a treacherous attempt to reach the summit of the world's highest mountain, \\\"Everest\\\" documents the awe-inspiring journey of two different expeditions challenged beyond their limits by one of the fiercest snowstorms ever encountered by mankind. Their mettle tested by the harshest of elements found on the planet, the climbers will face nearly impossible obstacles as a lifelong obsession becomes a breathtaking struggle for survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"tJalSBJy8q4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"L81fQ57hvQw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"O6LNXkQTEPI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""}